# Every text file is stored with LF in the repository, whatever line endings
# the working copy or the tool that saved it uses. Files once committed with
# CRLF were never converted by core.autocrlf, so any tool saving them with LF
# turned them into whole-file diffs (normalized 2026-11-15).
* text=auto

# Binary assets, never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.fnt binary
*.stb binary
*.dat binary
*.glb binary
*.zip binary
*.aseprite binary
*.ico binary
